{"parentUuid":"768f2f50-36e5-435a-848e-7ca28675c7d4","isSidechain":true,"agentId":"a1bf9e23bdb17aa09","message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5","id":"msg_011Cg22QSvae86QhzwnWKkjE","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01LvpnLPNHGppHHYb9Zhnp5p","name":"WebSearch","input":{"query":"STN1170 ISO 15765-4 29-bit flow control STmin BS STPBR multi-frame STPX command"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3936,"cache_read_input_tokens":129639,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":3936,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":5,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"wireToolInputs":{"toolu_01LvpnLPNHGppHHYb9Zhnp5p":{"query":"STN1170 ISO 15765-4 29-bit flow control STmin BS STPBR multi-frame STPX command"}},"serverClassifierRequest":"1890cf52-f6ce-4db6-88fc-8f06e62d8966","apiBlockIndex":2,"requestId":"req_011Cg22QSfwrqP1ZU9d34acQ","attributionAgent":"general-purpose","type":"assistant","uuid":"945c3491-4589-4d8b-bd40-9b5ea3c8d394","timestamp":"2026-10-14T11:08:59.327Z","effort":"high","perTurnEffort":null,"userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"C:\\Users\\User\\mcp-servers","sessionId":"7cb02eb5-e299-4baf-b34b-9eb82aebbf17","version":"2.1.282","gitBranch":"HEAD","slug":"binary-splashing-comet"}
{"parentUuid":"768f2f50-36e5-435a-848e-7ca28675c7d4","isSidechain":true,"promptId":"cde09b07-6881-403c-9d9a-f467b27b1473","agentId":"a1bf9e23bdb17aa09","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01XZ4SCY7LmFNT3wVVHEAq9X","type":"tool_result","content":"Web search results for query: \"STN1170 OBDLink STN11xx command reference STBR STFAP STFPA pass filter manual PDF\"\n\nLinks: [{\"title\":\"OBD STN1100 SERIES PROGRAMMING MANUAL Pdf Download\",\"url\":\"https://www.manualslib.com/manual/3741300/Obd-Stn1100-Series.html\"},{\"title\":\"​OBDLink​​®​​Family​ ​Reference and​ ​Programming Manual​ ​(FRPM)​\",\"url\":\"https://www.scantool.net/scantool/downloads/234/stn1100-frpm-preliminary.pdf\"},{\"title\":\"Scan Tools\",\"url\":\"https://www.scantool.net/scantool/downloads/archive/product-documentation/\"},{\"title\":\"STN1170 OBD, SW-CAN, MS-CAN to UART Chip, ELM327 Compatible\",\"url\":\"https://www.scantool.net/stn1170/\"},{\"title\":\"STN1170 Bluetooth OBD-II Adapter Manual : Free Download, Borrow, and Streaming : Internet Archive\",\"url\":\"https://archive.org/details/manualzilla-id-5710472\"},{\"title\":\"OBDLink® Software Developers Resource Page\",\"url\":\"https://www.obdlink.com/developers/\"},{\"title\":\"stn1170 Chip Multiprotocol OBD To UART Interpreter Datasheet\",\"url\":\"https://www.scribd.com/document/264863481/stn1170-chip-Multiprotocol-OBD-to-UART-Interpreter-Datasheet\"},{\"title\":\"OBDLink® Family Reference and Programming Manual (FRPM)\",\"url\":\"https://device.report/m/9a0c19e7c21abf30e5f5bed54411f5adb256424912a751b845dcfa1eb4611598.pdf\"},{\"title\":\"STX11\",\"url\":\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/STX11\"},{\"title\":\"STN1100 Family Reference and Programming Manual PRELIMINARY: DO NOT DISTRIBUTE\",\"url\":\"https://filedn.com/l8OQOK51ql1J391d2ApmLb0/arq/obd-ii/stn1100-frpm-preliminary_2013-10.pdf\"}]\n\nBased on the search results, I found relevant documentation for the STN1170 and STN11xx command reference:\n\n## Key Resources Found:\n\nThe STN11xx/STN21xx OBDLink Family Reference and Programming Manual (FRPM) is available as a PDF, which contains the comprehensive command reference you're looking for.\n\nThe manual covers the STN1170 along with other STN11xx devices, and includes documentation on the STN11xx filtering system and ST commands.\n\n## Available Documentation:\n\n1. **ManualsLib Source**: The OBD STN1100 Series programming manual is available online as a PDF download at manualslib.com\n\n2. **Official FRPM PDF**: The official OBDLink FRPM (obdlink_frpm_f.pdf) is available from scantool.net, sized at 1.4 MB with over 27,000 downloads\n\n3. **Manufacturer Resources**: OBDLink products are based on the OBD Solutions STN11xx IC series, with detailed AT/ST commands documented in the OBDLink Family Reference and Programming Manual\n\nThe FRPM manual should contain the specific ST commands you mentioned (STBR, STFAP, STFPA) and their pass filter configurations. You can access these from the scantool.net product documentation page or the ManualsLib source.\n\n\nREMINDER: You MUST include the sources above in your response to the user using markdown hyperlinks."}]},"uuid":"39a9dffd-038e-4204-81f1-5e441da4cfda","timestamp":"2026-10-14T11:09:04.949Z","toolUseResult":{"query":"STN1170 OBDLink STN11xx command reference STBR STFAP STFPA pass filter manual PDF","results":[{"tool_use_id":"srvtoolu_01JmuXRhcbxrtFMovsonWnR2","content":[{"title":"OBD STN1100 SERIES PROGRAMMING MANUAL Pdf Download","url":"https://www.manualslib.com/manual/3741300/Obd-Stn1100-Series.html"},{"title":"​OBDLink​​®​​Family​ ​Reference and​ ​Programming Manual​ ​(FRPM)​","url":"https://www.scantool.net/scantool/downloads/234/stn1100-frpm-preliminary.pdf"},{"title":"Scan Tools","url":"https://www.scantool.net/scantool/downloads/archive/product-documentation/"},{"title":"STN1170 OBD, SW-CAN, MS-CAN to UART Chip, ELM327 Compatible","url":"https://www.scantool.net/stn1170/"},{"title":"STN1170 Bluetooth OBD-II Adapter Manual : Free Download, Borrow, and Streaming : Internet Archive","url":"https://archive.org/details/manualzilla-id-5710472"},{"title":"OBDLink® Software Developers Resource Page","url":"https://www.obdlink.com/developers/"},{"title":"stn1170 Chip Multiprotocol OBD To UART Interpreter Datasheet","url":"https://www.scribd.com/document/264863481/stn1170-chip-Multiprotocol-OBD-to-UART-Interpreter-Datasheet"},{"title":"OBDLink® Family Reference and Programming Manual (FRPM)","url":"https://device.report/m/9a0c19e7c21abf30e5f5bed54411f5adb256424912a751b845dcfa1eb4611598.pdf"},{"title":"STX11","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/STX11"},{"title":"STN1100 Family Reference and Programming Manual PRELIMINARY: DO NOT DISTRIBUTE","url":"https://filedn.com/l8OQOK51ql1J391d2ApmLb0/arq/obd-ii/stn1100-frpm-preliminary_2013-10.pdf"}]},"Based on the search results, I found relevant documentation for the STN1170 and STN11xx command reference:\n\n## Key Resources Found:\n\nThe STN11xx/STN21xx OBDLink Family Reference and Programming Manual (FRPM) is available as a PDF, which contains the comprehensive command reference you're looking for.\n\nThe manual covers the STN1170 along with other STN11xx devices, and includes documentation on the STN11xx filtering system and ST commands.\n\n## Available Documentation:\n\n1. **ManualsLib Source**: The OBD STN1100 Series programming manual is available online as a PDF download at manualslib.com\n\n2. **Official FRPM PDF**: The official OBDLink FRPM (obdlink_frpm_f.pdf) is available from scantool.net, sized at 1.4 MB with over 27,000 downloads\n\n3. **Manufacturer Resources**: OBDLink products are based on the OBD Solutions STN11xx IC series, with detailed AT/ST commands documented in the OBDLink Family Reference and Programming Manual\n\nThe FRPM manual should contain the specific ST commands you mentioned (STBR, STFAP, STFPA) and their pass filter configurations. You can access these from the scantool.net product documentation page or the ManualsLib source."],"durationSeconds":6.3790048999786375,"searchCount":1},"serverClassifierContext":{"request":"1890cf52-f6ce-4db6-88fc-8f06e62d8966","context":{"git_state":{"cwd":"/c/Users/User/mcp-servers","root":null,"branch":null,"default_branch":null,"status":null,"visibility":null,"error":"pending"},"live_cwd":"/c/Users/User/mcp-servers","platform":"windows"}},"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"768f2f50-36e5-435a-848e-7ca28675c7d4","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"C:\\Users\\User\\mcp-servers","sessionId":"7cb02eb5-e299-4baf-b34b-9eb82aebbf17","version":"2.1.282","gitBranch":"HEAD","slug":"binary-splashing-comet"}
{"parentUuid":"945c3491-4589-4d8b-bd40-9b5ea3c8d394","isSidechain":true,"promptId":"cde09b07-6881-403c-9d9a-f467b27b1473","agentId":"a1bf9e23bdb17aa09","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01LvpnLPNHGppHHYb9Zhnp5p","type":"tool_result","content":"Web search results for query: \"STN1170 ISO 15765-4 29-bit flow control STmin BS STPBR multi-frame STPX command\"\n\nLinks: [{\"title\":\"ISO 15765-2\",\"url\":\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/ISO_15765-2\"},{\"title\":\"CAN TP (ISO 15765 - 2)\",\"url\":\"https://www.linkedin.com/pulse/can-tp-iso-15765-2-vivek-maurya\"},{\"title\":\"The Vehicle May Be Sick: Denial of Diagnostic Services by Exploiting the CAN Transport Protocol\",\"url\":\"https://arxiv.org/pdf/2604.23617\"},{\"title\":\"STN1170 Multiprotocol OBD to UART Interpreter Datasheet\",\"url\":\"https://www.scantool.net/downloads/132/stn1170-ds.pdf\"},{\"title\":\"CAN Part 8 - ISO 15765, KWP2000, ODB, and UDS (Automotive Diagnostic Command Set)\",\"url\":\"http://hooovahh.blogspot.com/2017/07/can-part-8-iso-15765-kwp2000-odb-and.html\"},{\"title\":\"ISO 15765-4 Code: The Complete Guide to OBD-II over CAN\",\"url\":\"https://simmasoftware.com/iso-15765-4-code-the-complete-guide-to-obd-II-over-can/\"},{\"title\":\"CAN-TP Protocol - PiEmbSysTech - Embedded Systems & VLSI Lab\",\"url\":\"https://piembsystech.com/can-tp-protocol/\"},{\"title\":\"STN1170 OBD, SW-CAN, MS-CAN to UART Chip, ELM327 Compatible\",\"url\":\"https://www.scantool.net/stn1170/\"},{\"title\":\"Receive ISO15765-2 Multiframe Message\",\"url\":\"https://cdn.intrepidcs.net/support/VehicleSpy/spyReceiveISO15765.htm\"}]\n\nI found search results related to ISO 15765-4 flow control and multi-frame communication. Here's what I found:\n\n## ISO 15765-4 Flow Control and Multi-Frame Communication\n\nThe STN1170 supports ISO 15765-4 (CAN 250/500 kbps, 11/29 bit), which relates to the 29-bit addressing you mentioned.\n\n### Flow Control Parameters (STmin and BS)\n\nThe flow control frame has three PCI bytes specifying the interval between subsequent frames and how many consecutive frames may be sent (Block Size).\n\nMore specifically:\n- STmin is the minimum separation time between CFs (how fast sender may stream frames)\n- BS (Block Size) is how many CFs may be sent before the sender must pause for the next FC\n\n### Multi-Frame Communication\n\nFirst Frame (FF) + Consecutive Frames (CF) are used when the payload is bigger; receiver sends Flow Control (FC) to manage pacing.\n\nThe search results confirm the basic ISO 15765-4 protocol elements you mentioned, though specific technical documentation about STPBR and STPX commands for the STN1170 device would require access to more detailed product-specific documentation or datasheets that weren't fully captured in these search results.\n\n\nREMINDER: You MUST include the sources above in your response to the user using markdown hyperlinks."}]},"uuid":"3a5ef74f-26fa-4fb6-aa97-557cd81ab65e","timestamp":"2026-10-14T11:09:05.649Z","toolUseResult":{"query":"STN1170 ISO 15765-4 29-bit flow control STmin BS STPBR multi-frame STPX command","results":[{"tool_use_id":"srvtoolu_01DcoifigXoTs6JfNvbVDDJH","content":[{"title":"ISO 15765-2","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/ISO_15765-2"},{"title":"CAN TP (ISO 15765 - 2)","url":"https://www.linkedin.com/pulse/can-tp-iso-15765-2-vivek-maurya"},{"title":"The Vehicle May Be Sick: Denial of Diagnostic Services by Exploiting the CAN Transport Protocol","url":"https://arxiv.org/pdf/2604.23617"},{"title":"STN1170 Multiprotocol OBD to UART Interpreter Datasheet","url":"https://www.scantool.net/downloads/132/stn1170-ds.pdf"},{"title":"CAN Part 8 - ISO 15765, KWP2000, ODB, and UDS (Automotive Diagnostic Command Set)","url":"http://hooovahh.blogspot.com/2017/07/can-part-8-iso-15765-kwp2000-odb-and.html"},{"title":"ISO 15765-4 Code: The Complete Guide to OBD-II over CAN","url":"https://simmasoftware.com/iso-15765-4-code-the-complete-guide-to-obd-II-over-can/"},{"title":"CAN-TP Protocol - PiEmbSysTech - Embedded Systems & VLSI Lab","url":"https://piembsystech.com/can-tp-protocol/"},{"title":"STN1170 OBD, SW-CAN, MS-CAN to UART Chip, ELM327 Compatible","url":"https://www.scantool.net/stn1170/"},{"title":"Receive ISO15765-2 Multiframe Message","url":"https://cdn.intrepidcs.net/support/VehicleSpy/spyReceiveISO15765.htm"}]},"I found search results related to ISO 15765-4 flow control and multi-frame communication. Here's what I found:\n\n## ISO 15765-4 Flow Control and Multi-Frame Communication\n\nThe STN1170 supports ISO 15765-4 (CAN 250/500 kbps, 11/29 bit), which relates to the 29-bit addressing you mentioned.\n\n### Flow Control Parameters (STmin and BS)\n\nThe flow control frame has three PCI bytes specifying the interval between subsequent frames and how many consecutive frames may be sent (Block Size).\n\nMore specifically:\n- STmin is the minimum separation time between CFs (how fast sender may stream frames)\n- BS (Block Size) is how many CFs may be sent before the sender must pause for the next FC\n\n### Multi-Frame Communication\n\nFirst Frame (FF) + Consecutive Frames (CF) are used when the payload is bigger; receiver sends Flow Control (FC) to manage pacing.\n\nThe search results confirm the basic ISO 15765-4 protocol elements you mentioned, though specific technical documentation about STPBR and STPX commands for the STN1170 device would require access to more detailed product-specific documentation or datasheets that weren't fully captured in these search results."],"durationSeconds":6.308464099884033,"searchCount":1},"serverClassifierContext":{"request":"1890cf52-f6ce-4db6-88fc-8f06e62d8966","context":{"git_state":{"cwd":"/c/Users/User/mcp-servers","root":null,"branch":null,"default_branch":null,"status":null,"visibility":null,"error":"pending"},"live_cwd":"/c/Users/User/mcp-servers","platform":"windows"}},"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"945c3491-4589-4d8b-bd40-9b5ea3c8d394","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"